[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.090",
    "end": "00:00:00.810",
    "start_seconds": 0.09,
    "end_seconds": 0.81,
    "text": "Here's the truth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.140",
    "end": "00:00:06.300",
    "start_seconds": 4.14,
    "end_seconds": 6.3,
    "text": "I work with people all the time who"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.300",
    "end": "00:00:08.490",
    "start_seconds": 6.3,
    "end_seconds": 8.49,
    "text": "tell me incredible things and then"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.490",
    "end": "00:00:10.470",
    "start_seconds": 8.49,
    "end_seconds": 10.47,
    "text": "say, do you really think anyone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.470",
    "end": "00:00:12.630",
    "start_seconds": 10.47,
    "end_seconds": 12.63,
    "text": "wants to hear what I have to say?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.840",
    "end": "00:00:13.800",
    "start_seconds": 12.84,
    "end_seconds": 13.8,
    "text": "And when people say that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.800",
    "end": "00:00:15.660",
    "start_seconds": 13.8,
    "end_seconds": 15.66,
    "text": "to me, I tell them this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.200",
    "end": "00:00:18.420",
    "start_seconds": 16.2,
    "end_seconds": 18.42,
    "text": "I spend a week at a yoga retreat"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.420",
    "end": "00:00:20.070",
    "start_seconds": 18.42,
    "end_seconds": 20.07,
    "text": "center teaching storytelling"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.070",
    "end": "00:00:20.845",
    "start_seconds": 20.07,
    "end_seconds": 20.845,
    "text": "to about a dozen people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.630",
    "end": "00:00:22.830",
    "start_seconds": 21.63,
    "end_seconds": 22.83,
    "text": "The deal I have with them is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.830",
    "end": "00:00:24.540",
    "start_seconds": 22.83,
    "end_seconds": 24.54,
    "text": "this, you never have to speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.540",
    "end": "00:00:26.220",
    "start_seconds": 24.54,
    "end_seconds": 26.22,
    "text": "If you don't want to come in like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.220",
    "end": "00:00:27.930",
    "start_seconds": 26.22,
    "end_seconds": 27.93,
    "text": "a mushroom, sit down and learn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.200",
    "end": "00:00:30.119",
    "start_seconds": 28.2,
    "end_seconds": 30.119,
    "text": "No one ever does that except for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.119",
    "end": "00:00:32.759",
    "start_seconds": 30.119,
    "end_seconds": 32.759,
    "text": "once someone did a woman, she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.759",
    "end": "00:00:35.310",
    "start_seconds": 32.759,
    "end_seconds": 35.31,
    "text": "actually sat right next to me all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.310",
    "end": "00:00:37.140",
    "start_seconds": 35.31,
    "end_seconds": 37.14,
    "text": "week long and never said a word."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.800",
    "end": "00:00:40.379",
    "start_seconds": 37.8,
    "end_seconds": 40.379,
    "text": "On the last day of our class, a Sunday"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.379",
    "end": "00:00:42.239",
    "start_seconds": 40.379,
    "end_seconds": 42.239,
    "text": "morning, people are going around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.239",
    "end": "00:00:44.580",
    "start_seconds": 42.239,
    "end_seconds": 44.58,
    "text": "and sharing stories, and my mushroom"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.580",
    "end": "00:00:46.890",
    "start_seconds": 44.58,
    "end_seconds": 46.89,
    "text": "to my right finally makes a sound."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.400",
    "end": "00:00:48.180",
    "start_seconds": 47.4,
    "end_seconds": 48.18,
    "text": "She says, well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.214",
    "end": "00:00:51.525",
    "start_seconds": 49.214,
    "end_seconds": 51.525,
    "text": "I have something, I just don't know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.525",
    "end": "00:00:52.995",
    "start_seconds": 51.525,
    "end_seconds": 52.995,
    "text": "if anyone would want to hear it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.565",
    "end": "00:00:54.434",
    "start_seconds": 53.565,
    "end_seconds": 54.434,
    "text": "And I said, well, tell it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.434",
    "end": "00:00:55.964",
    "start_seconds": 54.434,
    "end_seconds": 55.964,
    "text": "to us and we will decide."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.265",
    "end": "00:00:58.095",
    "start_seconds": 56.265,
    "end_seconds": 58.095,
    "text": "So this is the story she tells us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.214",
    "end": "00:01:00.675",
    "start_seconds": 58.214,
    "end_seconds": 60.675,
    "text": "She said she was doing yoga one night"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:01.004",
    "end": "00:01:03.194",
    "start_seconds": 61.004,
    "end_seconds": 63.194,
    "text": "till about seven o'clock, and then she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.194",
    "end": "00:01:04.905",
    "start_seconds": 63.194,
    "end_seconds": 64.905,
    "text": "got in her car and for the first time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.905",
    "end": "00:01:06.585",
    "start_seconds": 64.905,
    "end_seconds": 66.585,
    "text": "in a long time, she had felt peace."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.795",
    "end": "00:01:08.985",
    "start_seconds": 66.795,
    "end_seconds": 68.985,
    "text": "She had finally sort of let go of the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.985",
    "end": "00:01:11.625",
    "start_seconds": 68.985,
    "end_seconds": 71.625,
    "text": "anger and resentment inside her and she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.625",
    "end": "00:01:13.545",
    "start_seconds": 71.625,
    "end_seconds": 73.545,
    "text": "was feeling good as she was driving home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.324",
    "end": "00:01:15.854",
    "start_seconds": 74.324,
    "end_seconds": 75.854,
    "text": "And then this car came"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.854",
    "end": "00:01:17.025",
    "start_seconds": 75.854,
    "end_seconds": 77.025,
    "text": "barreling up behind her."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.340",
    "end": "00:01:19.890",
    "start_seconds": 77.34,
    "end_seconds": 79.89,
    "text": "Her like tailgating, her weaving all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.890",
    "end": "00:01:21.930",
    "start_seconds": 79.89,
    "end_seconds": 81.93,
    "text": "over the road, and then all of that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.930",
    "end": "00:01:24.750",
    "start_seconds": 81.93,
    "end_seconds": 84.75,
    "text": "time she spent finding centeredness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.750",
    "end": "00:01:26.910",
    "start_seconds": 84.75,
    "end_seconds": 86.91,
    "text": "and peace in that yoga class."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.000",
    "end": "00:01:28.200",
    "start_seconds": 87.0,
    "end_seconds": 88.2,
    "text": "It was gone instantly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.200",
    "end": "00:01:29.790",
    "start_seconds": 88.2,
    "end_seconds": 89.78999999999999,
    "text": "She was angry at the person behind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.790",
    "end": "00:01:32.100",
    "start_seconds": 89.78999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 92.1,
    "text": "her, and then that person flew around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.100",
    "end": "00:01:35.070",
    "start_seconds": 92.1,
    "end_seconds": 95.07,
    "text": "her, went ahead and hit a pole,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.670",
    "end": "00:01:37.590",
    "start_seconds": 95.67,
    "end_seconds": 97.59,
    "text": "wrapped the car around a telephone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.590",
    "end": "00:01:40.170",
    "start_seconds": 97.59,
    "end_seconds": 100.17,
    "text": "pole, so she pulled over, she got out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.170",
    "end": "00:01:41.670",
    "start_seconds": 100.17,
    "end_seconds": 101.67,
    "text": "of the car and she ran over and she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.670",
    "end": "00:01:43.110",
    "start_seconds": 101.67,
    "end_seconds": 103.11,
    "text": "found the driver behind the wheel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.350",
    "end": "00:01:44.580",
    "start_seconds": 103.35,
    "end_seconds": 104.58,
    "text": "Very badly injured."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.910",
    "end": "00:01:46.200",
    "start_seconds": 104.91,
    "end_seconds": 106.2,
    "text": "So she called 9 1 1."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.410",
    "end": "00:01:47.940",
    "start_seconds": 106.41,
    "end_seconds": 107.94,
    "text": "Now she was up in the Berkshires"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.940",
    "end": "00:01:49.170",
    "start_seconds": 107.94,
    "end_seconds": 109.17,
    "text": "in Massachusetts, sort of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.200",
    "end": "00:01:50.190",
    "start_seconds": 109.2,
    "end_seconds": 110.19,
    "text": "in the middle of nowhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.340",
    "end": "00:01:52.470",
    "start_seconds": 110.34,
    "end_seconds": 112.47,
    "text": "And so the 9 1 1 operator said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.710",
    "end": "00:01:54.240",
    "start_seconds": 112.71000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 114.24000000000001,
    "text": "I need you to begin administering"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.240",
    "end": "00:01:55.920",
    "start_seconds": 114.24000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 115.92,
    "text": "first aid 'cause the ambulance is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.920",
    "end": "00:01:57.300",
    "start_seconds": 115.92,
    "end_seconds": 117.3,
    "text": "gonna take a while to get there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.630",
    "end": "00:01:59.580",
    "start_seconds": 117.63,
    "end_seconds": 119.58,
    "text": "So listening to the 9 1 1"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.580",
    "end": "00:02:01.050",
    "start_seconds": 119.58,
    "end_seconds": 121.05,
    "text": "operator, she began working"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.050",
    "end": "00:02:03.030",
    "start_seconds": 121.05,
    "end_seconds": 123.03,
    "text": "on this man behind the wheel."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.660",
    "end": "00:02:05.670",
    "start_seconds": 123.66,
    "end_seconds": 125.67,
    "text": "Eventually the ambulance arrives and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.670",
    "end": "00:02:07.680",
    "start_seconds": 125.67,
    "end_seconds": 127.68,
    "text": "they take over, but the ambulance"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.680",
    "end": "00:02:09.329",
    "start_seconds": 127.68,
    "end_seconds": 129.329,
    "text": "driver says, I need you to follow"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.329",
    "end": "00:02:10.979",
    "start_seconds": 129.329,
    "end_seconds": 130.97899999999998,
    "text": "me to the hospital because you were"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.979",
    "end": "00:02:12.329",
    "start_seconds": 130.97899999999998,
    "end_seconds": 132.329,
    "text": "with him for the first 10 minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.329",
    "end": "00:02:13.590",
    "start_seconds": 132.329,
    "end_seconds": 133.59,
    "text": "The doctors might wanna talk to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.040",
    "end": "00:02:15.570",
    "start_seconds": 134.04,
    "end_seconds": 135.57,
    "text": "She's annoyed about the whole"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.570",
    "end": "00:02:17.190",
    "start_seconds": 135.57,
    "end_seconds": 137.19,
    "text": "thing, but she agrees to go."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.400",
    "end": "00:02:18.990",
    "start_seconds": 137.4,
    "end_seconds": 138.99,
    "text": "So she follows the ambulance at the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.990",
    "end": "00:02:21.030",
    "start_seconds": 138.99,
    "end_seconds": 141.03,
    "text": "hospital and she takes her place in the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.030",
    "end": "00:02:22.650",
    "start_seconds": 141.03,
    "end_seconds": 142.65,
    "text": "waiting room to see if the doctors need"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.650",
    "end": "00:02:25.050",
    "start_seconds": 142.65,
    "end_seconds": 145.05,
    "text": "to talk to her while she's waiting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.110",
    "end": "00:02:26.910",
    "start_seconds": 145.11,
    "end_seconds": 146.91,
    "text": "In the waiting room, a woman"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.910",
    "end": "00:02:29.820",
    "start_seconds": 146.91,
    "end_seconds": 149.82,
    "text": "walks in, her best friend, she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.820",
    "end": "00:02:31.440",
    "start_seconds": 149.82,
    "end_seconds": 151.44,
    "text": "says, what are you doing here?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.800",
    "end": "00:02:33.450",
    "start_seconds": 151.8,
    "end_seconds": 153.45,
    "text": "And her best friend says, my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.450",
    "end": "00:02:35.520",
    "start_seconds": 153.45,
    "end_seconds": 155.52,
    "text": "husband was just in a car accident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.000",
    "end": "00:02:38.100",
    "start_seconds": 156.0,
    "end_seconds": 158.1,
    "text": "He put his car into a telephone pole."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.700",
    "end": "00:02:40.500",
    "start_seconds": 158.7,
    "end_seconds": 160.5,
    "text": "The woman had never met her"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.500",
    "end": "00:02:41.910",
    "start_seconds": 160.5,
    "end_seconds": 161.91,
    "text": "best friend's husband before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.329",
    "end": "00:02:43.950",
    "start_seconds": 162.329,
    "end_seconds": 163.95,
    "text": "They had never encountered each other"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.130",
    "end": "00:02:46.079",
    "start_seconds": 164.13,
    "end_seconds": 166.079,
    "text": "because the husband worked the night shift"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.470",
    "end": "00:02:48.030",
    "start_seconds": 166.47,
    "end_seconds": 168.03,
    "text": "and so they had never seen each other."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.840",
    "end": "00:02:50.190",
    "start_seconds": 168.84,
    "end_seconds": 170.19,
    "text": "The husband dies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.970",
    "end": "00:02:55.020",
    "start_seconds": 170.97,
    "end_seconds": 175.02,
    "text": "That man who she treated died shortly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.020",
    "end": "00:02:57.270",
    "start_seconds": 175.02,
    "end_seconds": 177.27,
    "text": "thereafter, and her best friend"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.270",
    "end": "00:02:59.460",
    "start_seconds": 177.27,
    "end_seconds": 179.46,
    "text": "says to her, I'm so glad that in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.460",
    "end": "00:03:01.200",
    "start_seconds": 179.46,
    "end_seconds": 181.2,
    "text": "my husband's final moments on this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.200",
    "end": "00:03:03.600",
    "start_seconds": 181.2,
    "end_seconds": 183.6,
    "text": "earth, he was with someone I loved."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.680",
    "end": "00:03:07.110",
    "start_seconds": 184.68,
    "end_seconds": 187.11,
    "text": "She tells us that story in that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.110",
    "end": "00:03:09.030",
    "start_seconds": 187.11,
    "end_seconds": 189.03,
    "text": "workshop, my mushroom, who doesn't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.030",
    "end": "00:03:11.519",
    "start_seconds": 189.03,
    "end_seconds": 191.519,
    "text": "speak all week, and then she says to us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.240",
    "end": "00:03:13.380",
    "start_seconds": 192.24,
    "end_seconds": 193.38,
    "text": "Do you really think that's a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.380",
    "end": "00:03:15.210",
    "start_seconds": 193.38,
    "end_seconds": 195.21,
    "text": "story anyone would want to hear?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.080",
    "end": "00:03:18.750",
    "start_seconds": 196.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 198.75,
    "text": "At that point, we're all crying and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.750",
    "end": "00:03:23.220",
    "start_seconds": 198.75,
    "end_seconds": 203.22,
    "text": "I can't imagine what it takes or"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.220",
    "end": "00:03:24.930",
    "start_seconds": 203.22,
    "end_seconds": 204.93,
    "text": "what might have happened to this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.930",
    "end": "00:03:27.420",
    "start_seconds": 204.93,
    "end_seconds": 207.42000000000002,
    "text": "woman to think that that story"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.870",
    "end": "00:03:29.790",
    "start_seconds": 207.87,
    "end_seconds": 209.79,
    "text": "doesn't want to be heard by everyone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.330",
    "end": "00:03:31.410",
    "start_seconds": 210.32999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 211.41,
    "text": "And yet, here's the truth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.070",
    "end": "00:03:34.530",
    "start_seconds": 212.07,
    "end_seconds": 214.53,
    "text": "I work with people all the time who"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.530",
    "end": "00:03:36.690",
    "start_seconds": 214.53,
    "end_seconds": 216.69,
    "text": "tell me incredible things and then"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.690",
    "end": "00:03:38.640",
    "start_seconds": 216.69,
    "end_seconds": 218.64,
    "text": "say, do you really think anyone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.640",
    "end": "00:03:41.010",
    "start_seconds": 218.64,
    "end_seconds": 221.01,
    "text": "wants to hear what I have to say?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.730",
    "end": "00:03:43.380",
    "start_seconds": 221.73,
    "end_seconds": 223.38,
    "text": "And what I always tell people is this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.459",
    "end": "00:03:46.920",
    "start_seconds": 224.459,
    "end_seconds": 226.92000000000002,
    "text": "if it means something to you, it will"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.920",
    "end": "00:03:48.690",
    "start_seconds": 226.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 228.69,
    "text": "mean something to other people too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.410",
    "end": "00:03:51.209",
    "start_seconds": 229.41,
    "end_seconds": 231.209,
    "text": "I think the tragedy of this world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.209",
    "end": "00:03:52.590",
    "start_seconds": 231.209,
    "end_seconds": 232.59,
    "text": "is that many of us walk through the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.590",
    "end": "00:03:54.810",
    "start_seconds": 232.59,
    "end_seconds": 234.81,
    "text": "world thinking that the moments of our"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.810",
    "end": "00:03:58.170",
    "start_seconds": 234.81,
    "end_seconds": 238.17000000000002,
    "text": "lives are meaningful only to us when"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.170",
    "end": "00:04:00.090",
    "start_seconds": 238.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 240.09,
    "text": "the world needs to hear your stories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.450",
    "end": "00:04:02.160",
    "start_seconds": 240.45,
    "end_seconds": 242.16,
    "text": "The world needed to hear that woman's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.160",
    "end": "00:04:04.709",
    "start_seconds": 242.16,
    "end_seconds": 244.709,
    "text": "story, and yet she sat there for a week"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.010",
    "end": "00:04:06.930",
    "start_seconds": 245.01,
    "end_seconds": 246.93,
    "text": "wondering if anyone wanted to hear it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.109",
    "end": "00:04:08.670",
    "start_seconds": 247.109,
    "end_seconds": 248.67,
    "text": "I don't want that to be the case for you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.060",
    "end": "00:04:09.870",
    "start_seconds": 249.06,
    "end_seconds": 249.87,
    "text": "If you have something in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.870",
    "end": "00:04:10.829",
    "start_seconds": 249.87,
    "end_seconds": 250.829,
    "text": "your heart and your mind."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.205",
    "end": "00:04:13.155",
    "start_seconds": 251.205,
    "end_seconds": 253.155,
    "text": "That means something to you that touches"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.155",
    "end": "00:04:14.955",
    "start_seconds": 253.155,
    "end_seconds": 254.955,
    "text": "your heart and mind in a meaningful way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.225",
    "end": "00:04:16.695",
    "start_seconds": 255.225,
    "end_seconds": 256.695,
    "text": "I promise you other people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.695",
    "end": "00:04:17.385",
    "start_seconds": 256.695,
    "end_seconds": 257.385,
    "text": "want to hear it too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.985",
    "end": "00:04:19.065",
    "start_seconds": 257.985,
    "end_seconds": 259.065,
    "text": "They'll even wanna hear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.065",
    "end": "00:04:20.355",
    "start_seconds": 259.065,
    "end_seconds": 260.355,
    "text": "it if you tell it poorly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.435",
    "end": "00:04:24.255",
    "start_seconds": 261.435,
    "end_seconds": 264.255,
    "text": "The right story told poorly is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.255",
    "end": "00:04:25.845",
    "start_seconds": 264.255,
    "end_seconds": 265.845,
    "text": "still a great story to tell."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.445",
    "end": "00:04:28.605",
    "start_seconds": 266.445,
    "end_seconds": 268.605,
    "text": "So ask yourself, does"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.605",
    "end": "00:04:29.565",
    "start_seconds": 268.605,
    "end_seconds": 269.565,
    "text": "it mean something to me?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.065",
    "end": "00:04:33.105",
    "start_seconds": 271.065,
    "end_seconds": 273.105,
    "text": "And if it does, I promise you it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.105",
    "end": "00:04:34.935",
    "start_seconds": 273.105,
    "end_seconds": 274.935,
    "text": "will mean something to others too."
  }
]
